GOAL
  Prove your identity, print your location, and clear the screen.

COMMANDS TO USE
  whoami   → reveals your username
  pwd      → prints your current path
  clear    → wipes the screen (Ctrl+L also works visually)

HOW
  Run each command on its own line. For clear, prefer typing "clear".
  Ctrl+L often is NOT saved in history — if quest cannot see it, run:
    quest log clear

WHEN DONE
  quest check
EOF
      ;;
    s2)
      cat <<EOF
